#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:5
#: 0e8f3a59d0c4403aa0536cb359c194e4
msgid "Moving Vehicle Initialization"
msgstr "运动平台初始化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:7
#: 70aea9a27f0e4b54995a778bacd95e20
msgid ""
"ArduPilot allows taking off from a moving platform such as boats or other "
"moving vehicles.  It is basically a change to how the gyros are calibrated."
msgstr "ArduPilot 支持从船只或其他运动平台上起飞。这基本上是对陀螺仪校准方式的一种改变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:13
#: 0b68ccb123014933a514d7b7b132e4f5
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:15
#: 5d17505b502d4a12bcb96d14bb1bfd85
msgid ""
"In many cases Copters, Rovers, and Planes will be able to take off from a "
"moving platform without any special parameter changes as long as the "
"platform is not moving too rapidly during the gyro calibration which occurs "
"a few seconds after startup (look for the LEDs flashing red and blue)."
msgstr ""
"在许多情况下，Copter、Rover 和 Plane 无需任何特殊参数更改，即可从运动平台起飞，只要在启动后几秒钟内（观察 LED "
"红蓝交替闪烁期间）进行陀螺仪校准时平台不剧烈运动即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:17
#: 7927b54fc53c4b60b6950b35b6974d6e
msgid ""
"If the platform is moving too much however, the gyro calibration will fail "
"after 30 seconds and gyro related warnings like \"Bad Gyro Health\" will "
"appear on the HUD.  Despite this warning the vehicle may fly normally but "
"having the warning is unnerving and may hide other errors.  In this case, it"
" is best to disable the automatic gyro calibration by setting the "
":ref:`INS_GYR_CAL <INS_GYR_CAL>` parameter to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"但如果平台运动过于剧烈，陀螺仪校准将在 30 秒后失败，HUD 上会出现「Bad Gyro "
"Health」等陀螺仪相关警告。尽管有此警告，飞行器可能仍能正常飞行，但该警告令人不安，并可能掩盖其他错误。此时最好通过将 "
":ref:`INS_GYR_CAL <INS_GYR_CAL>` 参数设为「0」来禁用自动陀螺仪校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:20
#: e7961d47cdbd4c3f80a6babb41c8bd38
msgid "Manually trigger gyro calibration"
msgstr "手动触发陀螺仪校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:22
#: 5cc769e517944da6a7470fdac49ddff2
msgid ""
"Note that even with automatic gyro calibration disabled, the gyros "
"calibration can be triggered manually from the Mission Planner (and perhaps "
"some other ground stations) using the Flight Data screen's Actions tab.  "
"Select \"PREFLIGHT_CALIBRATION\" from the top-left drop-down and then press "
"the \"Do Action\" button."
msgstr ""
"请注意，即使禁用了自动陀螺仪校准，仍可通过 Mission Planner（可能还有其他地面站）的飞行数据界面 Actions "
"选项卡手动触发陀螺仪校准。从左上角下拉菜单中选择「PREFLIGHT_CALIBRATION」，然后按「Do Action」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-moving-vehicle-initialization.rst:27
#: 4a43c94bea3a47a082d27c47f2e727df
msgid ""
"This is useful if for some reason a gyro calibration is required and the "
"vehicle can be temporarily placed on a near non-moving platform."
msgstr "这在某些情况下很有用，例如需要进行陀螺仪校准，但飞行器可以暂时放置在接近静止的平台上。"
